{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Tech is a cozy survival simulation game where you journey through the wilderness toward Grandma\u2019s house. With intuitive, realistic survival mechanics, every choice matters as you learn, adapt, and grow. Each successful journey unlocks new skills, gear, and challenges waiting at her door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hike  to move closer to Grandma, but try not to turn your journey into a cautionary tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.poster.avif?t=1763575465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.webm?t=1763575465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.mp4?t=1763575465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up camp to rest, and explore to gather resources to prepare for the journey ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.poster.avif?t=1763575465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.webm?t=1763575465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.mp4?t=1763575465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your survival skills with mini-games: navigate using the stars or the rising sun, or be delayed on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/3da31d616aaffe07d97cb3fa004d9fca.avif?t=1763575465\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep visiting Grandma to earn new tools and skills, and carry them into your next run until the day she deems you ready for grander adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/830b6af24801000d5caa276a5ab3a0c4.avif?t=1763575465\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to know the moment the demo or full game is ready? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Survival Tech to your wish list</strong> and you\u2019ll get a heads-up as soon as it goes live.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976010?t=1763575465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976010?t=1763575465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/e352bf07882788f201353ae2a9a6582ed65e430c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763575465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/e352bf07882788f201353ae2a9a6582ed65e430c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763575465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival T