: navigate using the stars or the rising sun, or be delayed on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/3da31d616aaffe07d97cb3fa004d9fca.avif?t=1763575465\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep visiting Grandma to earn new tools and skills, and carry them into your next run until the day she deems you ready for grander adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/830b6af24801000d5caa276a5ab3a0c4.avif?t=1763575465\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to know the moment the demo or full game is ready? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Survival Tech to your wish list</strong> and you\u2019ll get a heads-up as soon as it goes live.</p>","developers":["truckbot"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/24004d09e1fca23162ced3a974c74d1c739f4484/header.jpg?t=1763575465","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976010/2074487679/ab74959fcb5560f5bf24f3d871f6573f910fda58/1762298796/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762299013","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.s